{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0001-PASSAGE", "text": "Functional Movement Science (HAS4867)\nManual Muscle Testing (MMT)\nManual muscle testing is a procedure for the evaluation of the strength of\nindividual muscles and muscle groups based on the performance of a movement\nin relation to manual resistance.\nPatients are asked to hold a position against a therapist’s resistance.\nResistance needs to be applied gradually in the opposite direction of muscle\nbeing tested.\nBoth sides should be tested to provide a comparison.\nMuscle Strength Grading Scale (Oxford Scale)\n• Grade 0: No contraction\n• Grade1: Visible/palpable muscle contraction but no movement\n• Grade2: Completes ROM with gravity eliminated\n• Grade 3: Completes ROM against gravity only\n• Grade 4: Completes ROM against gravity with some resistance\n• Grade 5: Completes ROM against gravity with full resistance Testing position\n• Anti-Gravity – for muscle strength Grade 3 or above\n• Gravity Eliminated – for muscle strength Grade 2 or below", "document_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "source_file": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0001"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0001", "document_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "source_file": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf", "page_number": 1, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 1, "pdf_page": 1, "formatted": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf, slide 1 (PDF p. 1)"}], "slide_number": 1, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0001", "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-PART01", "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)"], "content_type": "slide_text", "ocr_text": null, "status": "generated_not_verified", "verification_status": "generated_not_verified"}
{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002-PASSAGE", "text": "subject whether he/she can do a full ROM or not (Grade 2)\n2. Shoulder Extension\nSubject Test Position\nProne lying with arm by the side, palm facing up\nAction\nAsk the subject to extend arm to end range, and hold the position against\ntherapist’s manual resistance\nExaminer’s Resistance\nExaminer stabilizes the subject’s scapula and gives the resistance above the\nelbow\nGravity Eliminated Position\nSide lying with the testing arm supported by the examiner, and check the\nsubject whether he/she can do a full ROM or not (Grade 2)\n3. Shoulder Abduction\nSubject Test Position\nSitting with arm by the side\nAction\nAsk the subject to abduct arm up to 90° with palm facing down, and hold the\nposition against therapist’s manual resistance\nExaminer’s Resistance\nExaminer stabilizes the subject’s scapula and gives the resistance above the\nelbow\nGravity Eliminated Position\nSupine lying with the testing arm supported by the bed, and check the subject\nwhether he/she can do a full ROM or not (Grade 2)\n4. Shoulder Internal Rotation\nSubject Test Position\nProne lying with arm abducting to 90°, elbow flexed to 90°, with palm facing\nbackward\nAction\nAsk the subject to swing arm backward to almost end range, and hold the\nposition against therapist’s manual resistance\nExaminer’s Resistance\nExaminer stabilizes the subject’s humerus and gives the resistance above the\nwrist\nGravity Eliminated Position\nSitting with the testing arm by the side of body, elbow flexed to 90°, and check\nthe subject whether he/she can do a full ROM or not (Grade 2)", "document_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "source_file": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002", "document_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "source_file": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf", "page_number": 2, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 2, "pdf_page": 2, "formatted": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf, slide 2 (PDF p. 2)"}], "slide_number": 2, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002", "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-PART01", "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "Slide 2"], "content_type": "slide_text", "ocr_text": null, "status": "generated_not_verified", "verification_status": "generated_not_verified"}
