{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0008-PASSAGE", "text": "3. Inversion\nSubject Test Position\nSitting on high plinth, legs over the edge of the plinth with ankle in slighted\nplantarflexion\nAction\nAsk the subject to invert the ankle, and hold the position against therapist’s\nmanual resistance\nExaminer’s Resistance\nExaminer stabilizes the leg just above the ankle and gives the resistance on the\nmedial side of the foot\nGravity Eliminated Position\nSupine lying, and check the subject whether he/she can invert the foot or not\n(Grade 2)\n4. Eversion\nSubject Test Position\nSitting on high plinth, legs over the edge of the plinth with ankle in slighted\nplantarflexion\nAction\nAsk the subject to evert the ankle, and hold the position against therapist’s\nmanual resistance\nExaminer’s Resistance\nExaminer stabilizes the leg just above the ankle and gives the resistance on the\nlateral side of the foot\nGravity Eliminated Position\nSupine lying, and check the subject whether he/she can evert the foot or not\n(Grade 2)", "document_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "source_file": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0008"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0008", "document_id": "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "source_file": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf", "page_number": 8, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 8, "pdf_page": 8, "formatted": "04 - 2. Manual Muscle Testing.pdf, slide 8 (PDF p. 8)"}], "slide_number": 8, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0008", "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-PART01", "HHS4867-L02-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)", "Lecture 2 - Manual Muscle 